{
    "_README": [
        "API routes that exist on disk and are NOT described in src/generated/openapi.json.",
        "",
        "DISCOVERED, NOT DESIGNED. `public/openapi.json` described ZERO endpoints until",
        "#947/#948/#953 — 47 schemas and no paths — and `paths?:` was typed optional, so",
        "zero endpoints counted as a documented API. This list is what is left.",
        "",
        "RULES:",
        "  · A route file NOT registered and NOT listed here FAILS the build. New",
        "    undocumented routes are blocked; the tail is not.",
        "  · An entry that IS now registered, or whose file no longer exists, ALSO",
        "    fails, with instructions to delete it. The list cannot rot into a",
        "    permanent allowlist.",
        "  · UNDOCUMENTED_CEILING must be lowered in the same diff that removes",
        "    entries. It never rises without a reviewer seeing the line.",
        "",
        "WHY A BASELINE AND NOT A SWEEP: registering the remaining tail is ~18,600 lines",
        "at the current density, and only 5 of 45 tenant sub-areas have a matching",
        "response-DTO module — 256 of the 349 tenant methods need DTOs authored before",
        "they can be described at all. Registration is the smaller half of that work.",
        "Holding this guard hostage to it would leave the gap ungated meanwhile, which",
        "is the state that let the tail grow unnoticed in the first place. Tracked in",
        "#944.",
        "",
        "ONE EXEMPTION, in the guard rather than here:",
        "  src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts — NextAuth's catch-all. It serves a",
        "  family of endpoints under one file and has no single OpenAPI path template,",
        "  so it is not describable by this mapping rather than merely undescribed."
    ],
